<view class="page" wx:if="{{room}}">
  <view class="cover" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,{{room.color}}55,{{room.color}}cc);">
    <image wx:if="{{room.cover}}" src="{{room.cover}}" mode="aspectFill" class="cover-img" binderror="onCoverError"></image>
    <view class="cover-name">{{room.name}}</view>
    <view class="cover-en">{{room.nameEn}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="section">
    <view class="title-row">
      <text class="title">{{room.name}} · {{room.type}}</text>
      <text class="price">¥{{room.price}}<text class="unit">起/晚</text></text>
    </view>
    <view class="meta">{{room.area}} · {{room.beds}} · 最多{{room.maxGuests}}人入住</view>
    <view class="tags">
      <text class="tag tag-stone" wx:for="{{room.tags}}" wx:for-item="t" wx:key="*this">{{t}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="section">
    <view class="h">房间介绍</view>
    <view class="desc">{{room.desc}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="section">
    <view class="h">房间设施</view>
    <view class="amenities">
      <view class="a-item" wx:for="{{amenities}}" wx:key="*this">
        <text class="a-icon">✓</text>
        <text class="a-name">{{item}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="section">
    <view class="h notice-title">直订专属权益</view>
    <view class="notice-box">
      <view class="n-item"><view class="dot" style="background:var(--color-gold);"></view>欢迎礼升级（岩涺石定制白茶+手作小怪兽）</view>
      <view class="n-item"><view class="dot" style="background:var(--color-stone-blue);"></view>优先房型升级（如有空房）</view>
      <view class="n-item"><view class="dot" style="background:var(--color-primary);"></view>添加管家企微，一对一服务</view>
      <view class="n-tagline">* 不打折，只做非折价权益 · 价格=OTA同价</view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="bottom-bar">
    <view class="b-price">¥{{room.price}}<text class="unit">起/晚</text></view>
    <button class="btn-primary b-btn" bindtap="book">立即预订</button>
  </view>
</view>
